    "b0040-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "3d2e45b9374ad8e5757015832e66bc7d0d143eba207342e8eb33c2655c0c9209",
      "targetHash": "fc74c74b18bec359dd2f44c18e346e8a482ebb70c26f343cf6142ef6c98ef5e7",
      "machineHash": "fc74c74b18bec359dd2f44c18e346e8a482ebb70c26f343cf6142ef6c98ef5e7",
      "machineText": "在此期間，這個專案發生了巨大的變化。2021 年 9 月，首個適用於 Windows 的 Wails v2 測試版發布時，儲存庫約有 4000 顆星。到了 2022 年 9 月發布 v2 時，約有 10300 顆星。如今已超過 35000 顆星。這樣的成長是一份榮幸，但也改變了妥善維護專案的意義：更多使用者仰賴發布決策，更多貢獻者需要明確的參與途徑，而更多工作著重於讓專案具備可預期性，而不只是加入下一項功能。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The project has changed enormously during that time. When the first Wails v2\\ beta shipped for Windo…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0041-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "c509b8c18d2d655e16b01f9e09ce5dc8d534a8c5c4b323508ecf55cacde3495c",
      "targetHash": "6a543fda8317965817f21649e83f61b58baf647c9d673162f7e197c3ab0a431c",
      "machineHash": "6a543fda8317965817f21649e83f61b58baf647c9d673162f7e197c3ab0a431c",
      "machineText": "我並非總能像這樣的成長所要求的那般迅速、清楚地調整我們的流程。這是我的責任。解決之道不是許下宏大的承諾，也不是讓每項決策都變成繁文縟節；而是更清楚地說明哪些項目受到支援、哪些仍屬實驗性質、決策如何制定，以及我們接下來要做什麼。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I have not always adapted our processes as quickly or as clearly as that growth\\ required. I own tha…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
