      "targetHash": "d02c210da3ae1878e2280d80de7ccdb3ec8e13011af26a4d00d30d64ffcf422f",
      "machineHash": "d02c210da3ae1878e2280d80de7ccdb3ec8e13011af26a4d00d30d64ffcf422f",
      "machineText": "我們也將重新啟用 [Wails subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/)，並在 v3 邁向正式發布的過程中積極維護它，讓它成為另一個進行實務討論、提問與提供意見回饋的場所。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "We are also relaunching the [Wails subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/)\\ and will actively ma…",
